<title>SPAIN: Sol Melia 9-mth profit rises 32.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Sol Melia 9-mth profit rises 32.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish hotel chain Sol Melia for the first nine months of 1996 to September (in billions of pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax profit			   4.497    up   32.6 pct</p>
<p> Sales				     7.950    up   19.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: In a statement, the company said diversification enabled it to soften the effect of a slowdown in the Spanish hotel sector.</p>
<p>It added 18 hotels to its network during the period and now manages 196 hotels in 25 countries. The company said it would add 14 more to its chain by the end of the year.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +34 1 585 2171</p>
</text>
